5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I need to check how the flat fee lands on different members.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I worry about the hesitation in the evenings. Why do people hesitate to commit to a simple fee?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know who actually shows up. Why do the same faces do everything while others pay and vanish?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to understand the true time cost of managing the books before we set the fee.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry that making the fee structure too visible will scare off the quiet newcomers who just want to drift in and find their feet.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, I think the hesitation is because nobody trusts the numbers. I need to see the actual ledger to know what we are really paying for.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, that makes sense. If the numbers are opaque, trust erodes. I will look into the ledger to see where the money actually goes.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, I agree. But I need to see the sign-in sheets to prove who is actually doing the work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, attendance is useful, but I need to see the treasurer's logged hours to understand the real burden.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, I agree. But I also need to see the taster evening forms to understand why newcomers hesitate to fully join.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, I get that, but we need to know if the quiet ones are actually staying. I will check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I understand. I will look into the weekday turnout since the summer outings to see if the hesitation is real or just my perception.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
