18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, I will check the bank statements on last year's renewals. I need to see the actual cash flow to understand the administrative load.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, I will check the taster evening forms and the sign-in sheets. I need to see if the quiet ones are actually staying or just drifting away.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
